{
    "title": "Messenger SMS - Text Messages",
    "description": "Messenger for SMS is a custom texting Messenger (SMS &MMS) app with <b>countless emojis, themes, fonts, wallpapers, ringtones and everything you want. Fully customized by you!</b>\r\n\r\n<b>3000+ free new emojis, stickers, GIFs</b> make messenger more fun. Stay in touch with friends anytime and anywhere with Messenger by sharing picture, audio, video even having group messages. Using a funny texting messenger chat app to replace stock messenger app!\r\n\r\nMessenger - text and send messages safely with <b>free private box, messages blocker, even backup & restore messenger and schedule SMS</b>! Don\u2019t need to worry about losing private messenger and missing big moments. And avoid spam messages to waste your phone storage by blocking text messenger.\r\n\r\nEnjoy sending & blocking text messenger with funny Text Messenger Chat App.\r\n\r\n<b>Messenger app Key Features</b>\r\n\r\n<b>Funny Emoji Messenger</b>\r\n- Fastly text 3000+ free funny face, emoji & emoticons from messenger directly\r\n- Text Messenger Chat App support all new free funny emoji & funny face in text messenger\r\n\r\n<b>Animated Gif & Emoji Art</b>\r\n- Share thousands of free hot trending GIFs MMS via Messenger MMS\r\n- Share unique free Emoji Art & funny face with friends via Messenger SMS\r\n\r\n<b>Customize Messenger Theme</b>\r\n- Tons of amazing messaging themes\r\n- Customize messenger background as you wish\r\n\r\n<b>Awesome Messenger Customization</b>\r\n- Customize texting bubble, color, font & wallpaper in Messenger\r\n- Take a photo as messenger wallpaper or choose wallpaper from photo gallery\r\n\r\n<b>Backup & Restore Messenger</b>\r\n- Backup SMS & MMS to cloud, messages never get lost\r\n- Restore deleted or lost messages at any time\r\n\r\n<b>Private Messenger Box</b>\r\n- Encrypt messages or contacts & lock down with private Messenger box\r\n- Hide private messenger box icon to protect privacy from being snooped\r\n\r\n<b>SMS Blocker</b>\r\n- With free messenger blocker, no worry about spam messenger consume storage space \r\n- Block text messenger via adding to SMS blocker\r\n\r\n<b>Funny Messenger Collection</b>\r\n- 10+ categories messenger you can choose\r\n- Express love, romance, and friendship and other emotions with quick text messenger\r\n\r\n<b>Caller ID</b>\r\n- Identify numbers in real time - even those are not in your contact list\r\n- Get warnings for more than 1 million spam numbers worldwide\r\n\r\n<b>Connect calls with Messenger</b>\r\n- One click adds a contact after each call. No need to input number again\r\n- Access other Messenger features directly from caller ID screen\r\n\r\n<b>Schedule Message</b>\r\n- Delayed SMS Messenger gives an opportunity to correct the wrong message\r\n- Never miss any big moment with scheduled SMS Messenger\r\n\r\n<b>Driving Mode & Auto Reply</b>\r\n- Driving Mode disables messenger notifications from messenger or stock messenger except phone call\r\n- Auto Reply when Driving Mode is turned on, keep distractions to a minimum\r\n\r\n<b>More Features</b>\r\n- Clipboard for multiple fast copy and paste text messenger\r\n- Pop up a new message for a quick view and quick reply\r\n- Quickly search to find exactly what you are looking for in text messages\r\n\r\n<b>Contact Us</b>\r\nEmail: smsmessagesfeedback@gmail.com\r\n\r\nTexting messenger has never been so great with <b>emoji, GIF, sticker, theme, private box, blocker, backup & restore function and scheduled messages!</b>\r\n\r\nWe are constantly working hard on making the \u201cMessenger\u201d more perfect for your SMS & MMS Texting needs. Please feel free to email us for any suggestions or just say hello. We would love to hear from you. If you have enjoyed any feature of \u2018Messenger\u2019. Tell your friends if you are enjoying funny Text Messenger.\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://adsms.textfun.net/policy/privacy_policy.html\r\nUser Agreement: https://adsms.textfun.net/useragreement/useragreement.html",
    "descriptionHTML": "Messenger for SMS is a custom texting Messenger (SMS &amp;MMS) app with <b>countless emojis, themes, fonts, wallpapers, ringtones and everything you want. Fully customized by you!</b><br><br><b>3000+ free new emojis, stickers, GIFs</b> make messenger more fun. Stay in touch with friends anytime and anywhere with Messenger by sharing picture, audio, video even having group messages. Using a funny texting messenger chat app to replace stock messenger app!<br><br>Messenger - text and send messages safely with <b>free private box, messages blocker, even backup &amp; restore messenger and schedule SMS</b>! Don\u2019t need to worry about losing private messenger and missing big moments. And avoid spam messages to waste your phone storage by blocking text messenger.<br><br>Enjoy sending &amp; blocking text messenger with funny Text Messenger Chat App.<br><br><b>Messenger app Key Features</b><br><br><b>Funny Emoji Messenger</b><br>- Fastly text 3000+ free funny face, emoji &amp; emoticons from messenger directly<br>- Text Messenger Chat App support all new free funny emoji &amp; funny face in text messenger<br><br><b>Animated Gif &amp; Emoji Art</b><br>- Share thousands of free hot trending GIFs MMS via Messenger MMS<br>- Share unique free Emoji Art &amp; funny face with friends via Messenger SMS<br><br><b>Customize Messenger Theme</b><br>- Tons of amazing messaging themes<br>- Customize messenger background as you wish<br><br><b>Awesome Messenger Customization</b><br>- Customize texting bubble, color, font &amp; wallpaper in Messenger<br>- Take a photo as messenger wallpaper or choose wallpaper from photo gallery<br><br><b>Backup &amp; Restore Messenger</b><br>- Backup SMS &amp; MMS to cloud, messages never get lost<br>- Restore deleted or lost messages at any time<br><br><b>Private Messenger Box</b><br>- Encrypt messages or contacts &amp; lock down with private Messenger box<br>- Hide private messenger box icon to protect privacy from being snooped<br><br><b>SMS Blocker</b><br>- With free messenger blocker, no worry about spam messenger consume storage space <br>- Block text messenger via adding to SMS blocker<br><br><b>Funny Messenger Collection</b><br>- 10+ categories messenger you can choose<br>- Express love, romance, and friendship and other emotions with quick text messenger<br><br><b>Caller ID</b><br>- Identify numbers in real time - even those are not in your contact list<br>- Get warnings for more than 1 million spam numbers worldwide<br><br><b>Connect calls with Messenger</b><br>- One click adds a contact after each call. No need to input number again<br>- Access other Messenger features directly from caller ID screen<br><br><b>Schedule Message</b><br>- Delayed SMS Messenger gives an opportunity to correct the wrong message<br>- Never miss any big moment with scheduled SMS Messenger<br><br><b>Driving Mode &amp; Auto Reply</b><br>- Driving Mode disables messenger notifications from messenger or stock messenger except phone call<br>- Auto Reply when Driving Mode is turned on, keep distractions to a minimum<br><br><b>More Features</b><br>- Clipboard for multiple fast copy and paste text messenger<br>- Pop up a new message for a quick view and quick reply<br>- Quickly search to find exactly what you are looking for in text messages<br><br><b>Contact Us</b><br>Email: smsmessagesfeedback@gmail.com<br><br>Texting messenger has never been so great with <b>emoji, GIF, sticker, theme, private box, blocker, backup &amp; restore function and scheduled messages!</b><br><br>We are constantly working hard on making the \u201cMessenger\u201d more perfect for your SMS &amp; MMS Texting needs. Please feel free to email us for any suggestions or just say hello. We would love to hear from you. If you have enjoyed any feature of \u2018Messenger\u2019. Tell your friends if you are enjoying funny Text Messenger.<br><br>Privacy Policy: https://adsms.textfun.net/policy/privacy_policy.html<br>User Agreement: https://adsms.textfun.net/useragreement/useragreement.html",
